tats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-59ad1546a1fe4fe6END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-dcec459f6f81a83eEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_GeneralGoodsStore_ChildRecipe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralGoodsStore_ChildRecipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralGoodsStore_ChildRecipe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d16c720f-6a79-4ab8-9195-db701de73936</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d16c720f-6a79-4ab8-9195-db701de73936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d16c720f-6a79-4ab8-9195-db701de73936\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a shelf inside <a href=\"/wiki/Tefoco%27s_Home\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tefoco's Home\">Tefoco's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-70&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-116</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A lovingly preserved cookie recipe scrawled in a child's handwriting.]\n</p><p><br>\nBest cukies\n</p><p>by Maggie age 6\n</p><p><br>\nIngrediant\n</p><p>butter\n</p><p>shugar\n</p><p>egg\n</p><p>flower\n</p><p>chokluts\n</p><p><br>\n1.  mix ingredients\n</p><p>2. make cukie shapes\n</p><p>3. put cukies in stowve\n</p><p>4. yum yum yum!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212933\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23874/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5687/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931357/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.606      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.606      1 -total\n 50.23%   20.395      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.83%   18.205     15 Template:Trim\n 24.97%   10.138      2 Template:Uid\n 16.42%    6.669      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.94%    5.660      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.06%    4.084      1 Template:Books\n  9.54%    3.873      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.39%    3.814      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34878-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212933 and revision id 329420. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}